Date: Tue, 03 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/15] FreeChat: create channels on iOS

Creating a room offers "Channel": right after creation its power levels
are changed so that only moderators and admins post, while everyone
can still react.
